# IntelliJ IDEA — personal IDE settings, never commit these
**/.idea/
*.iml

# Java bytecode — javac output, rebuilt from the .java source, never committed
*.class

# Resumable /system-check evidence — local runtime state, never committed
/.system-check/

# Skill invocation counter — local rolling denominator, never committed
/notes/prompts/_internal/_skill-runs.md

# Local secrets for docker compose — never committed; .env.example documents the names
.env
